# move-dumper

TypeScript tool (not scaffolded yet). Dumps labelled positions and moves from [foochu/bgweb-api](https://github.com/foochu/bgweb-api).

- Convert at the boundary per `docs/domain/gnubg.md`. Store our JSON + evals only.
- On-disk batches: `docs/domain/dump-format.md` under `move-dumper/dumps/`.
- Do not call the gnubg CLI. Never commit `dumps/`. Fixtures in `move-dumper/fixtures/` may be committed.
- Do not add `package.json` or a TS toolchain unless the user asks.
